          { id: "qna-seasonality-04", level: 2, q: "In a production setting that's mostly stochastic with occasional abrupt shifts, why would sliding-window or discounted UCB typically beat EXP3 despite EXP3 having the stronger worst-case guarantee?", difficulty: "hard" }
