      { id: "qna-case-deceptive-accuracy-01", level: 3, q: "A model reports a strong accuracy number and a loss curve that fell nicely throughout training, but you're suspicious it isn't actually useful. Walk me through how you'd verify whether it's really working, and what would make you distrust that accuracy number.", difficulty: "medium" }
